<title>MEXICO: New Mexico to Mexico cattle export update -USDA.</title>
<headline>New Mexico to Mexico cattle export update -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly update of New Mexico cattle exports to Mexico, to July 26 - USDA. (Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year).</p>
<p>	Beef cattle		Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		     970	    17,687     2,511</p>
<p>    Calves			    0		   1	   0</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females    42	     1,477	   0</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females   322	     5,643	 822</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530. E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com))</p>
